{"4887750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Until Done", "steam_appid": 4887750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chasing the Truth, Caught in a Nightmare</strong> Until Done tells the chilling story of Beyza, a female journalist who travels to the isolated Silver Lake Farm to investigate the mysterious disappearance of three children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoping to find answers in this desolate land, Beyza discovers mysterious notes belonging to the missing children and their families. While the authors of the notes are clearly known by the names on them, who placed them there and for what purpose remains a complete enigma. As she tries to piece together the clues, she discovers with horror that she has become the target of a demonic entity relentlessly hunting her from the pitch-black darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to experience this nightmare through Beyza's eyes, trying to survive in a tense night atmosphere and along the dark, eerie paths of the forest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Light is Your Only Shield:</strong> You cannot completely destroy the entity pursuing you, but you are not defenseless. By using your flashlight's powerful mode at the right moments, you can temporarily blind and slow down the demon, gaining crucial seconds to lose your trail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Dark Secrets:</strong> Carefully search for the notes scattered around Silver Lake Farm. Reading every single page without missing a clue will bring you closer step by step to the horrific truth of what happened to the children.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suffocating and Eerie Atmosphere:</strong> From a first-person (FPS) perspective, the tension never drops as you navigate the forest paths relying solely on the beam of your flashlight. Every shadow and every sound could spell your end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do You Have the Courage to Learn the Truth?:</strong> Beyza's journalistic curiosity dragged her into this hell. Will you be able to survive long enough to bring the truth to light?</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chasing the Truth, Caught in a Nightmare</strong> Until Done tells the chilling story of Beyza, a female journalist who travels to the isolated Silver Lake Farm to investigate the mysterious disappearance of three children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoping to find answers in this desolate land, Beyza discovers mysterious notes belonging to the missing children and their families. While the authors of the notes are clearly known by the names on them, who placed them there and for what purpose remains a complete enigma. As she tries to piece together the clues, she discovers with horror that she has become the target of a demonic entity relentlessly hunting her from the pitch-black darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to experience this nightmare through Beyza's eyes, trying to survive in a tense night atmosphere and along the dark, eerie paths of the forest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Light is Your Only Shield:</strong> You cannot completely destroy the entity pursuing you, but you are not defenseless. By using your flashlight's powerful mode at the right moments, you can temporarily blind and slow down the demon, gaining crucial seconds to lose your trail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Dark Secrets:</strong> Carefully search for the notes scattered around Silver Lake Farm. Reading every single page without missing a clue will bring you closer step by step to the horrific truth of what happened to the children.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suffocating and Eerie Atmosphere:</strong> From a first-person (FPS) perspective, the tension never drops as you navigate the forest paths relying solely on the beam of your flashlight. Every shadow and every sound could spell your end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do You Have the Courage to Learn the Truth?:</strong> Beyza's journalistic curiosity dragged her into this hell. Will you be able to survive long enough to bring the truth to light?</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "While tracing the mysterious disappearance of three children, a woman journalist finds herself trapped in a living nightmare at a desolate farm. Plunge into the dead of night with a first-person perspective—Until Done will test your sanity with its bone-chilling atmosphere!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887750/0d91c940e48f6da7d3b6600038dc628da56413dd/header.jpg?t=1784877406", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887750/9f0432365ba04aeee08743a50a2bf04dc4789615/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784877406", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887750/9f0432365ba04aeee08743a50a2bf04dc4789615/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784877406", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10-11 Operating Systems<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-4590 @ 3.30GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Controller Support is Available</l